{
  "_createdAt": "2026-03-31T14:59:05Z",
  "_id": "drafts.post-ai-notetakers-vs-manual-notetaking-sales-reps",
  "_rev": "5Qkylho2vlnZKz9zlEHHDb",
  "_system": {
    "base": {
      "id": "post-ai-notetakers-vs-manual-notetaking-sales-reps",
      "rev": "LobHPX0rlFo71dStNy4B4m"
    }
  },
  "_type": "post",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-08-05T06:50:50Z",
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "ea01eca20ce2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9039ca19da28",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "TL;DR:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "645864b4b567",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Manual notes force a choice between active listening and accurate capture. Sales reps switching to an AI notepad get a third option: jot rough notes during the call, let the AI enhance them afterward. The result is better documentation, cleaner CRM data, and more recall on the calls that matter most. Tell participants you're using Granola to transcribe the call."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f1e16d1a0ae1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "37acea248acf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Back-to-back discovery calls create a documentation problem that compounds with every meeting. The more present you are in the conversation, the less you capture. The more you write, the more you miss. Most reps know the trade-off. Fewer have figured out that there's a way to keep both: stay in the conversation and still end up with an accurate record of it."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d0fe957b8f03",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7f8a3f2c067d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We'll show you what the data reveals about each approach, where each falls short."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b5aee3dde742",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e508870a606c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The trade-off: active listening vs. accurate capture"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "17b24587f9d9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "99683841bd2c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The limits of manual notes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0b1d1c6afab2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c017146c46e9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sales reps spend just over a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "141cbc0936d8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "70bdbfa0dd51"
          ],
          "text": "third of their time actually selling"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5601c018ce1b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " (30%), which works out to roughly 14 hours of a 40-hour week. According to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "09da26771d62",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "c9e648a962f0"
          ],
          "text": "Salesgenie research"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3f74e06a9aec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", 43% of reps report that administrative work occupies between 10 and 20 hours each week."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "70bdbfa0dd51",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://spotio.com/blog/sales-statistics/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c9e648a962f0",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.salesgenie.com/blog/sales-productivity-statistics/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "278a52db9154",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b07cd3cd1ee3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Manual notes make that gap worse. When you're scribbling during a discovery call, you divide your cognitive load between listening, processing, and writing. What gets lost:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e9537d613b3e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6179e2d2638b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Budget figures blur:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "65d603e4b341",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " \"$285K base with 20% bonus target\" becomes \"~$280K total\""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7e9e9e315c70",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "345b8ae59522",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Objections lose specificity:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0e8845e0d680",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " \"Integration complexity with our legacy ERP system\" becomes \"technical concerns\""
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d7506809515e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "648fea32895d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Exact language disappears:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "56323147cf1a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The specific pain point phrasing that makes follow-up emails land"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5f08d0bf4671",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "635926fe34bc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You remember the gist, but in sales, gist doesn't close deals."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "595885bbb308",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a502c33f7c4a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The memory argument and why fidelity matters more in sales"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "818e1bfe3f44",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8e10fdba3795",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Handwriting has real benefits. Writing by hand "
        },
        {
          "_key": "2d2a08acd4c5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "4dfd43b4cd1f"
          ],
          "text": "activates broader brain regions"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c0913989412f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " tied to memory and sensory processing than typing does, according to research in Scientific American. Handwriting also encourages annotation, connecting disparate ideas in ways that deepen processing and recall."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "4dfd43b4cd1f",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/why-writing-by-hand-is-better-for-memory-and-learning/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "674f99548d9a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c60919cea79b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The problem is that better retention of the gist doesn't compensate for lower fidelity on specifics. In sales, \"approximately $280K\" and \"$285K base with 20% bonus target\" are genuinely different numbers. Verbatim objections inform coaching, positioning, and negotiation. Handwriting aids memory but, as "
        },
        {
          "_key": "12560736192f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "182266ff794c"
          ],
          "text": "research on note-taking quality confirms"
        },
        {
          "_key": "770a757c1ea6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", tends to sacrifice verbatim accuracy in the process."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "182266ff794c",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.mdpi.com/2075-1729/15/3/345"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "be44aaae242f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "eb7b0cd92553",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The AI advantage: productivity and pipeline visibility"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d7857f28be2e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ca43ba3461ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Automating the admin burden"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a4f747339cc2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c2f92d8a7d69",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "AI notetaking tools eliminate the most repetitive parts of post-call work. What gets automated:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "94b6bda57caf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "201ef4be8540",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Real-time transcription"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9c961ea04e7f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " capturing everything said verbatim"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "94b9db0d14fd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "700721d53b57",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Meeting summaries"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dbd4d7b42444",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " highlighting key decisions and discussion points"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "793ea637a820",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1fa063665061",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Action item extraction"
        },
        {
          "_key": "241ba02ac93c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " pulling next steps without manual review"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5b56aeca6c20",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ee5d0a767b6e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "CRM field population"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00cedaf162c9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " filling qualification data directly from the transcript"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "659a5b5af4ae",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fd1691d48434",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "07a2804773ad"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's AI-enhanced notes workflow"
        },
        {
          "_key": "57c5bc2bbaa6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " reflects this principle: you jot rough bullets during the call, and Granola uses those notes alongside the full transcript to generate structured summaries after the meeting ends. You can "
        },
        {
          "_key": "efb45b68f09f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "0e326cebd097"
          ],
          "text": "customize transcription output"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9bd0d365bcc6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to tailor the format to your sales methodology."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "07a2804773ad",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/ai-enhanced-notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0e326cebd097",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/customising-transcription"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "886dbb1e0151",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "582384a4bfb1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Granola nails exactly what I need: clean, reliable meeting transcripts and smart follow-up summaries without any fluff. I use it for nearly every call to stay focused on the conversation instead of scribbling notes. The follow-up action items are especially useful. Huge time saver.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "08a0e2ecf61f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "56e841411b82"
          ],
          "text": "Verified user on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b04d42e588ba",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "56e841411b82",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11289286"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ff852152c211",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "07dcc6f352aa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "CRM hygiene and coaching intelligence"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5d8fd89c6797",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "84a587960d18",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Accurate transcripts give managers a second benefit: coaching without shadowing. When you have a full record of what was actually said on a discovery call, deal reviews become specific. Managers can identify where objections were handled well and where a rep missed a signal, without sitting in on every call."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d3c41574ddce",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c476344a9f33",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For teams running MEDDIC or similar frameworks, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "75d94a8342ab",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "77f79f67a16e"
          ],
          "text": "automatic qualification data extraction"
        },
        {
          "_key": "09cc6db92adf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " reduces the gap between what reps say they captured and what's in the CRM. Granola supports "
        },
        {
          "_key": "0f59e581f8de",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "8543b2e76554"
          ],
          "text": "custom note templates"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c088cee95c41",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " that you can configure to match your team's qualification framework, so every enhanced note follows the same structure regardless of who ran the call."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "77f79f67a16e",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.momentum.io/meddic-autopilot"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8543b2e76554",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/customise-notes-with-templates"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c27ee13221cf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "be7c67a5a786",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"I find Granola incredibly helpful and intuitive for taking notes in meetings. I appreciate being able to customize note formats and access full transcripts for reference. The note summaries Granola creates are also a standout, making it easy to get concise or detailed notes as needed.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "fe22ecd4ad1f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "60b1c5afe1ef"
          ],
          "text": "Catherine S. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e4437ddc53d2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "60b1c5afe1ef",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11755500"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3873fdb40acf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6e2217344ebd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When manual notes still have a place"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e2f9f8416e65",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f2e3649bb26d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "AI notetaking tools solve a real problem, but they're not right for every context. Manual notes remain genuinely better in a few situations:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "58a0a0b2e365",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "94400b44db24",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Short internal syncs (under 15 minutes):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4d52231d6376",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The overhead of reviewing enhanced notes often exceeds the value gained from a quick status check."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "de519c3a1e81",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4904548c57aa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "In-person meetings where devices signal disengagement:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ff9a50e380ed",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " In executive conversations where opening a laptop reads as checked out, a notepad in hand can reinforce attention rather than undermine it."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "36d7f57d213a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "79f927ba3d6c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Strategic signaling moments:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2c89cc2cb33e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Visibly writing something down communicates that a specific point mattered. Sometimes that signal is the point."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "86c3c4286262",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "75db293734bd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The hybrid approach acknowledges both realities. You jot the signals that matter during the call, while an AI notepad captures the substance of everything said. You don't have to choose between being present and being accurate."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2830151b307a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b32bddfd3007",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Love that I can just be 100% present in meetings and not worry about taking notes. I can just write down things I really care about and let Granola take care of the rest.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a736f0ad0728",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ae90014ce262"
          ],
          "text": "Jess M. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c240126712fd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "ae90014ce262",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-9856422"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3ea7bc45597d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "adc5e47aa9df",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why documentation quality matters most on high-stakes calls"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "30230e8841d4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "13b2a2897819",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "High-stakes sales calls put the most pressure on documentation: budget figures, verbatim objections and commitments all need to be captured exactly, and reconstructing them from memory afterwards is where deals lose detail."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ec91a4fc4e62",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "11649e976274",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "On discovery calls, executive negotiations and competitive positioning discussions, the details that decide a deal are the ones easiest to lose: exact figures, the precise wording of an objection, who committed to what. Reps who can stay in the conversation and rely on an accurate record afterwards recall more of it and follow up with more precision."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2ab6489706f3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2d9e29d9f1d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The calls that most benefit from accurate documentation are also the ones where the details are hardest to hold onto: discovery calls, executive negotiations, competitive positioning discussions. Getting the figures, the objections and the commitments down exactly is what makes the follow-up land."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e878bb1066f5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bd68277e9d5a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes. Tell the other participants you're using it to transcribe the call, then focus on the conversation."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4f2a09ae81c8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4fde44354ef0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The verdict: why reps prefer an AI notepad"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8c20ca7a7128",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3e134c7a99a4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The comparison across all three approaches looks like this:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "html0",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 20%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 30%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 25%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Approach</th>\n<th>Accuracy</th>\n<th>Rapport</th>\n<th>Post-call admin</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Manual notes</td>\n<td>Low fidelity on specifics</td>\n<td>High (no technology friction)</td>\n<td>High (reconstruction time)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meeting bots</td>\n<td>High verbatim capture</td>\n<td>Automated capture, no manual notes</td>\n<td>Low (automation)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Granola</td>\n<td>High (transcript + human judgment)</td>\n<td>High (you stay in the conversation)</td>\n<td>Low (one-click enhanced notes)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0ca1c2ecbac4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0086327d26c8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes. Let the other participants know you're using Granola to transcribe the call, then give the conversation your full attention — the notes are assembled for you afterwards."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "885a672e0b8e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "881714f5a08f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Granola was a very simple tool to set up and start using. It has been extremely useful in making notes on calls with prospective customers as well as team meetings, and allows me to focus on the conversation with confidence, that the important points are being noted.\" - "
        },
        {
          "_key": "635254758add",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7af44e4aa131"
          ],
          "text": "Tom S. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "15215a638f73",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7af44e4aa131",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-9856398"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00799ce4e1b6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dd16d28dcca7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The same trade-off applies to sales engineers, customer success reps, and anyone running high-touch conversations: the more attention you give the person in front of you, the more you rely on an accurate record afterwards."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ee8eaa3ab53f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "393fe485d169",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to evaluate AI note-taking software for sales"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "36b27b225d95",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "912549689e80",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Use these four criteria as a quick filter when assessing options:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "99a8358c4832",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c519964300ec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Capture method: Does the tool join the call as a participant or capture audio from your device? Either way, tell participants you're using it to transcribe the call."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "34b6e316d45c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8135cf6e249b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "CRM integration:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "36e363e2064e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Granola offers "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d0862607a687",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "1f1fc60dedbf"
          ],
          "text": "native integration with HubSpot, Attio, and Affinity"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7f3a0909a144",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", with Salesforce accessible via Zapier. Verify your primary CRM is supported before committing."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "1f1fc60dedbf",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/integrations-with-granola"
