      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c13bfc642531",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dae8281ccd44",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Security standards:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "49641d8605bd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Look for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "751f566a6dcb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7c47e0fa73fa"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2 certification"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a568de675d4a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " and a clear answer on whether your meeting data trains AI models. Granola completed SOC 2 Type 2 certification in July 2025 and contractually prohibits third-party AI providers from training on your data, as detailed in the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "cf0728a8d2bd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "c48c0b32df07"
          ],
          "text": "Granola security documentation"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f0c0f1ebcd65",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7c47e0fa73fa",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/updates/granola-is-soc2-type-2-compliant"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c48c0b32df07",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/security"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7a3e8331bd5e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "414651f027c4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Template customization:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c022266c064a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Can the output format match your qualification methodology? MEDDIC fields, next steps, and deal stage signals should map directly to your CRM structure."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "number",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "73fe569305a8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d8fc8e2440cc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "f04897fd8e8a"
          ],
          "text": "Granola's privacy policy"
        },
        {
          "_key": "891f9ff9c9ea",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " makes the data architecture explicit: audio is transcribed in real time then deleted. No recordings are stored anywhere."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "f04897fd8e8a",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://help.granola.ai/article/privacy-policy"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "25c7eb449c23",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "98f3018cb8a9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Easy to set up. Accurate discussion summaries with the backup transcript available.\" -"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5cfaf74f7218",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "af5a9ac06144"
          ],
          "text": "Joe M. on G2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "29f943e69bc7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "af5a9ac06144",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://g2.com/products/granola/reviews/granola-review-11055567"
        }
      ],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
      "_key": "267f6679cfa7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "640e3f6acabc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Getting started with Granola"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "90295fb676fd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2ca5ebf330d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Setup takes under five minutes. Download the Mac or Windows app, connect your calendar, and Granola automatically detects your next meeting. When the call starts, open Granola and jot rough bullets on the points that matter to you. After the call, click \"Enhance notes\" and Granola fills in context, extracts action items, and structures the summary around your template."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a899c5f6f7ec",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "dc0a2eb05df0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Enhanced notes copy directly into your CRM notes field, cutting post-call admin significantly. CRM integrations and shared team folders require the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "24402b64fb7a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "de97d0746191"
          ],
          "text": "Business plan"
        },
        {
          "_key": "1c695a861a45",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " at $14 per user per month."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "de97d0746191",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/pricing"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2f33298f3e56",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c32d90fd80cf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Try Granola for free."
        },
        {
          "_key": "4e8407fd5af0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "_key": "92a3cf8f50fc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "92cc2c80a5dc"
          ],
          "text": "Download the Mac or Windows app"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c12886bce04f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", connect your calendar, and run your next discovery call. Tell the other participants you're using Granola to transcribe it, then stay present, jot what matters, and let Granola enhance the rest afterward."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "92cc2c80a5dc",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2536795f5b25",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8f7e66dfd2f4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "FAQ"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "76f56f9ee1e8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f3c779e7b849",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Should sales reps use "
        },
        {
          "_key": "6ee18f8e4802",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "44db505c9fc2"
          ],
          "text": "AI meeting notes"
        },
        {
          "_key": "33a2f3cd0615",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "44db505c9fc2",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/ai-meeting-assistant"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2abbfe90dc7e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d857f0951fc3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, particularly for discovery calls, demos, and negotiations where accurate capture of budget, timelines, and objections directly affects deal outcomes. For reps with four or more calls daily, post-call admin adds up fast and AI-enhanced notes reduce that burden significantly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "561d796820a1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "38c1bbfbb843",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Is "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a570d4f1d95f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong",
            "b82df4b24231"
          ],
          "text": "AI note-taking"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e8e8a70ed1df",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": " secure for confidential sales calls?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "b82df4b24231",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.granola.ai/ai-note-taker"
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "02f38fa1084b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cc964b7e82ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It depends on the tool's architecture. Granola is SOC 2 Type 2 certified as of July 2025, does not store audio recordings, and contractually prohibits third-party AI providers from training on your data. Enterprise plans include model training turned off by default for the entire organization."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ba0786efd786",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8995d98c8633",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can AI notes integrate with Salesforce and HubSpot?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "53b1a54fdc4a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "783b27971f9c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Granola offers native integration with HubSpot, Attio, and Affinity on Business plans ($14/user/month). Salesforce requires Zapier middleware."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a6abe86013da",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "536d6dcba9b5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What's the difference between a meeting bot and an AI notepad?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5e024402ed23",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "072fe4bb784e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A meeting bot joins your call as a named participant. An AI notepad runs on your laptop or phone and uses your device's audio to generate notes. Whichever you use, tell participants you're transcribing the call."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "768780c96ffd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bf1da1fe3bbe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Key terms"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ff7b8afaba20",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "a47124553397",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Discovery call:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5e1a0764b899",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A structured sales conversation designed to qualify a prospect's needs, budget, timeline, and decision-making process. Note-taking friction here creates the most downstream risk to deal accuracy."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b789eef0ec6c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "21f9a00a2391",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "CRM hygiene:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4171db7eb21b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " The accuracy and completeness of data in a customer relationship management system. Poor hygiene from incomplete post-call updates degrades forecast accuracy and coaching quality."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "5feb7952fabd",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6353109b7d01",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "MEDDIC:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ddd32d5af277",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A B2B sales qualification framework covering Metrics, Economic Buyer, Decision Criteria, Decision Process, Identify Pain, and Champion. AI tools can auto-extract MEDDIC fields from call transcripts to reduce manual CRM entry."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b8a738ad72cc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "860986e9bd79",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Bot-free capture:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3bbda54f7651",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A transcription approach where audio is captured directly from the user's device rather than by a bot joining the meeting as a visible participant."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a4ec83ad688b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9c48347ad926",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Human-in-the-loop:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "576002088b89",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " A workflow where human judgment guides AI output. In Granola, the rough notes you type during a call direct the AI's post-meeting enhancement, ensuring the final document reflects what mattered to you."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "620886996da8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "577bb91087de",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "SOC 2 Type 2:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3bf8fe9b083e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " An independent security audit certification that verifies a company's controls for data security, availability, and confidentiality over a sustained period. The relevant compliance benchmark for enterprise software handling sensitive conversations."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
